Project 1 — Clean Code Library System
Build a Java library system with business rules, interfaces, validation, exceptions, JUnit tests, clean separation of concerns and a documented refactoring history.
Project 2 — Test Management API
Build a FastAPI/PostgreSQL service for test cases, test executions, reports and authentication. Include migrations, OpenAPI docs, automated tests, Docker and CI.
