Project 3 — Secure Versioned REST API
Build a Spring Boot task/issue-management API with CRUD, validation, pagination, filtering, consistent errors, authentication, role-based authorization, migrations, OpenAPI, unit/integration tests and deployment instructions.
Project 4 — Transactional Inventory or Booking System
Demonstrate correct transactions, prevention of duplicate reservations, optimistic/pessimistic locking, deadlock investigation, query optimization before/after indexes and connection-pool saturation handling.
Exit criteria: You can design, implement, test, secure and document an API; model data; reason about transactions; and explain a query plan.
