Project 5 — Asynchronous Order Platform
Use Spring Boot, PostgreSQL, Redis, Kafka or RabbitMQ. Implement order processing, inventory reservation, notifications, outbox, idempotent consumers, bounded retries, dead-letter handling, consumer restart recovery and Saga compensation.
Project 6 — Multi-service Order Prototype
Document service responsibilities, communication choices, failure scenarios, retries, consistency guarantees, data ownership, compensation logic and architecture decision records (ADRs). Start as a modular monolith if that is the better engineering choice.
Optional advanced systems/data technologies
Cassandra: CQL, partition/clustering keys, denormalization, replication, consistency/quorum, SSTables, compaction, tombstones and hot partitions. Resource: https://cassandra.apache.org/doc/stable/cassandra/developing/data-modeling/
Spring Cloud: https://spring.io/projects/spring-cloud
RabbitMQ and Kafka
CQRS, event sourcing, Saga, replication, sharding and consensus
URL shortener, notification platform, Uber-style backend, Netflix-style backend, distributed cache and trading-engine design exercises
