Project 7 — Production Deployment
Containerize your API and database, create CI/CD, run tests before deployment, deploy locally or to a cloud test environment, configure probes, separate config from source, secure secrets, document rollback, and add logs/metrics/traces.
Project 8 — Production Reliability Report
Run controlled load tests, measure request rate, errors, p95/p99 latency, CPU/memory, query time and connection pool. Identify a bottleneck, implement an improvement and publish before/after evidence.
