AI-assisted frontend engineering
Use GitHub Copilot, Claude, Gemini, Codex, Cursor or Windsurf for components, refactoring, tests, debugging, documentation, performance/accessibility checks and reviews. Validate generated output for correctness, security, performance, maintainability and testability.
Project 9 — Full-stack Test Analytics Dashboard
React + TypeScript frontend, Spring Boot or FastAPI backend, PostgreSQL, authentication, test execution views, filters, reports, error states, tests, accessible design and CI/CD.
Project 10 — Enterprise Banking Dashboard
Build responsive dashboards for customers, transactions, payments and risk management; design system, light/dark themes, BFF, API gateway, microservices, observability, accessibility, security tests and performance budget.
Frontend architecture interview exercises
Netflix-style UI, Amazon-style UI, banking dashboard, trading dashboard, search UI, ChatGPT-like application, real-time monitoring dashboard and enterprise admin portal. Explain components, state, API/BFF, SSR, cache/CDN, performance, accessibility, security, observability, tests and CI/CD.
